namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Animated::animate(number deltaSeconds)
\brief Advance programmed animation by elapsed seconds.

Advances constant rates, scheduled animations and helpers. MVC controllers advance their Views automatically. Standalone AnimatedAttributes instances must be advanced explicitly; Drawing copies Attributes samples.

\param deltaSeconds Finite nonnegative elapsed seconds.

\return True if any animation value changed.

\see pauseSchedule(), addAnimationHelper()
*/
 }
